# MotherMode Sales Funnel — System Port

Status: **in progress** (Phases 1-3 complete, Phase 4 partial). Build passing.

## What it is

A DB-driven full sales funnel builder in the **Editorial Warm** MotherMode brand
(bone / ink / mode / brass), modeled on the optin funnel but extended to a
complete purchase path: optin, sales page, VSL, checkout, 4 upsells, success,
and access pages.

The existing optin funnel (`/admin/funnels`, `/optin/[slug]/**`) is **not
modified or deleted** — it served as the reference model. The new system lives
under its own slug namespace and admin route.

```
/funnel/[slug]            -> optin (lead capture)
/funnel/[slug]/sales      -> long-form sales page
/funnel/[slug]/vsl        -> video sales letter
/funnel/[slug]/checkout   -> Stripe checkout
/funnel/[slug]/upsell      -> OTO1
/funnel/[slug]/upsell-2    -> OTO2
/funnel/[slug]/upsell-3    -> OTO3
/funnel/[slug]/upsell-4    -> OTO4
/funnel/[slug]/success     -> receipt + delivery cards
/funnel/[slug]/access      -> members delivery + onboarding
```

Admin: `/admin/sales-funnels` (sidebar: **Sales Funnels**).

