## Schema

- `mothermode_sales_funnels` — identity, status, JSONB blocks for each page step
  (optin, sales, vsl, checkout, upsell1-4, success, access, footer), stats
  (views, conversions, checkouts, purchases, upsell yes/no counts, revenue),
  resource links (offer, lead-gen, deliverable, email kit, Stripe product).
- `mothermode_sales_funnel_leads` — unique `(funnel_id, email)`, UTM, step
  reached, purchase status + amount.
- `mothermode_sales_funnel_events` — event stream for analytics.
- RLS: service_role only. Public traffic goes through Next.js APIs.

## How to use

1. Apply migration `20260901000000_mothermode_sales_funnels.sql`.
2. Open `/admin/sales-funnels` -> **AI build** tab -> fill niche/audience/
   magnet/offer/upsells -> **AI: generate full funnel** (or Load MotherMode
   defaults).
3. Review all 14 tabs (AI build, optin, sales, VSL, checkout, upsell 1-4,
   success, access, footer, links, leads) -> set status to **published** ->
   Save.
4. Preview links in the editor header open each step in a new tab:
   `/funnel/{slug}`, `/funnel/{slug}/sales`, `/funnel/{slug}/vsl`, etc.
5. Leads tab shows captures with step reached, purchase status, UTM, CSV export.

## Editor features

- **14 tabs**: AI build, optin, sales page, VSL, checkout, upsell 1-4, success,
  access, footer, links, leads
- **AI self-build**: Fill a short brief (niche, audience, magnet, offer, price,
  4 upsell names/prices, tone notes) -> AI writes all 10 blocks in MotherMode
  voice
- **Preview links**: All 10 steps have preview links that open in new tabs
- **Publish checklist**: Slug, optin headline, sales headline, checkout price,
  checkout price (cents), success headline, access headline, footer disclaimer,
  email kit linked
- **Stats**: Views, optins, optin rate, purchases, checkout rate, upsell 1 take
  rate, revenue
- **Leads table**: Email, name, funnel, status, step reached, purchased, UTM,
  when + CSV export
- **Duplicate**: Clone a funnel as draft with unique slug suffix
- **ASCII-safe**: All UI text uses plain ASCII (no unicode symbols) to avoid
  encoding issues

## On-page inline edit (planned)

Admins who open any sales funnel page will see a floating **Edit page** toolbar
(same pattern as optin funnel). Click any copy field to patch it inline; Save
writes the merged funnel row back through `/api/admin/mothermode-sales`.

