## Design notes

- Content is JSONB blocks (MotherMode kit style), not 100 flat columns.
- Visual language matches `MotherModeSalesPage` / `HeroSection` wordmark.
- All page components reuse shared optin components (Wordmark, OptinFooter,
  MediaBlock) for layout consistency.
- The optin funnel is the reference model — same patterns, same store shape,
  same inline edit hook, same AI generator pattern.